    "details": "<p><strong>HACK IN HILLS &rsquo;26, MANALI</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Not a Marathon. A Mountain Sprint.</strong></p>\n<p>Hack in Hills &rsquo;26 is a 24+ hour offline hackathon in Manali, bringing together developers, designers, marketers, and Web3 and gaming creators to build, collaborate, and solve problems with the Himalayas as the backdrop.</p>\n<p>The team behind Hack in Hills has organized 300+ events, supported 15,000+ hackers, built communities of 50,000+ members, and worked with 50+ Web3 and gaming partners.</p>\n<p><strong>What to Expect:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>40+ selected hackers</li>\n<li>10,000+ registration target</li>\n<li>35+ Web3 and Gaming partners</li>\n<li>24+ hours of building</li>\n<li>Mentors, speakers and judges</li>\n<li>Networking with builders and ecosystem leaders</li>\n<li>50,000 INR bounty pool</li>\n<li>Offline finale in Manali</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The hackathon follows a three round journey, starting with idea submission, moving to prototype development, and ending with the final offline hackathon in Manali.</p>\n<p><strong>Round 1: Idea and PPT Submission</strong></p>\n<p><strong>10 September to 30 September 2026</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Online:</strong></p>\n<p>Submit a PPT or PDF covering:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Problem statement</li>\n<li>Proposed solution</li>\n<li>Innovation and uniqueness</li>\n<li>Target users and use case</li>\n<li>Technology or tech stack</li>\n<li>Expected impact</li>\n<li>Implementation roadmap</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The best ideas will be shortlisted for the Prototype Round.</p>\n<p><strong>Shortlisting: 1 to 3 October 2026</strong></p>\n<h2>Round 2: Prototype Development</h2>\n<p><strong>4 October to 31 October 2026</strong><br /><strong>Online</strong></p>\n<p>Shortlisted teams will build a functional prototype or MVP based on their submitted idea.</p>\n<p><strong>Teams may submit:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Working prototype or MVP</li>\n<li>Demo video</li>\n<li>GitHub or repository</li>\n<li>Documentation</li>\n<li>Prototype or demo link</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Projects will be evaluated on innovation, technical execution, feasibility, usability and potential impact.</p>\n<p><strong>Finalists announced: 3 to 5 November 2026</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Round 3: Grand Finale</strong></p>\n<p><strong>20 November 2026</strong><br /><strong>Manali, Himachal Pradesh</strong><br /><strong>24+ Hours | Offline</strong></p>\n<p>Finalists will come together in Manali for the final hackathon.</p>\n<p>Teams will build, improve and present their projects with access to mentors, judges and ecosystem leaders.</p>\n<p>Projects will be evaluated on:</p>\n<p><strong>Innovation, Technical Execution, Impact, Scalability, Problem-Solution Fit, User Experience and Final Presentation.</strong></p>\n<p>The final round will compete for the <strong>50,000 INR bounty pool</strong>.</p>\n<h2>Important Dates</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Stage</th>\n<th>Date</th>\n<th>Mode</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Round 1: PPT Submission</td>\n<td>10 Sep to 30 Sep</td>\n<td>Online</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Round 1 Shortlisting</td>\n<td>1 to 3 Oct</td>\n<td>Online</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Round 2: Prototype</td>\n<td>4 Oct to 31 Oct</td>\n<td>Online</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Finalists Announcement</td>\n<td>3 to 5 Nov</td>\n<td>Online</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Round 3: Grand Finale</td>\n<td><strong>20 Nov 2026</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Manali, Offline</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Ready to Build?</strong></p>\n<p>Take your idea from <strong>PPT to Prototype to the Mountain Finale</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Hack in Hills &rsquo;26</strong><br /><strong>Not a Marathon. A Mountain Sprint.</strong> ️</p>",
